        "original_id": "87ac8784-4a6d-5d82-b972-595360c4a87b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Asheville Regional Airport, Orlando, Florida, United States\n- Organizations: Orlando International Airport\n- Topics: airport passenger traffic, airport location, airport rankings\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Orlando International Airport handled more than 40.2 million passengers.\n- As of 2015, Orlando International Airport was the second-busiest airport in Florida.\n- In 2016, Asheville Regional Airport served a record 826,648 passengers, which was 5% higher than in 2015.\n- In 2016, Asheville Regional Airport recorded its third consecutive year of record passenger traffic.\n- Orlando International Airport is a major public airport located six miles southeast of Orlando, Florida, United States.",
